+## Changed
+
+- New `src/core/report/query-pauses.ts`. Exports `PAUSE_TABLES`, holding
+  `pauses(change, task, paused_at, until, source)`, and `insertPauses(db,
+  subjects)`. It lists each archived subject's digit-named `.jsonl` task
+  streams in numeric order, reads each with `readEventStream` through the
+  shared scope/index, and inserts one row per `paused` event: `change` the
+  folder name, `task`/`until`/`source` from the event's object `data`, and
+  `paused_at` the event's `timestamp`. An event without object `data` adds no
+  row, and a field of the wrong type reads as null. The insert carries the
+  three pause `@scenario` lines and `@adr 008`.
+- `src/core/report/query-tables.ts`: imports `PAUSE_TABLES`/`insertPauses`,
+  lists `...PAUSE_TABLES` in `HISTORY_TABLES` after `...TASK_OUTCOME_TABLES`,
+  and calls `insertPauses(db, subjects)` in `build` after `insertLinkFindings`.
+- `tests/query-command.test.ts`, `tests/query-trial-tables.test.ts`,
+  `tests/query-tables.test.ts`: only their pinned table lists gained the
+  `pauses(change, task, paused_at, until, source)` line / table entry after
+  `task_outcomes`; no other assertion changed.
+- New `tests/query-pauses.test.ts` proves "Pauses of one archived change",
+  "No pauses", "Pauses listed" and the reworded "Task outcomes listed" through
+  the real `osq query` command over a hand-written archive.
+
+Every acceptance line is implemented and the task verify
+(`node --import tsx --import ./tests/git-test-env.ts --test tests/query-pauses.test.ts`)
+passes. The full suite is 4038/4039; the single failure is the out-of-scope
+test below, so `pnpm verify` cannot pass.
+
+## Outside scope
+
+`tests/query-task-outcomes.test.ts` (written by archived change 186) still
+asserts, in its `task outcomes listed` case, that `task_outcomes(...)` is the
+last line `osq query` prints with no statement. This change's delta rewrites
+the "Task outcomes listed" scenario to say `task_outcomes(...)` comes directly
+after `link_findings` and adds `pauses` as the last line, so that assertion is
+obsolete and fails. The file is not in this task's `scope`, so I left it alone
+(`tests.modify` being true does not authorize a file outside `scope`). It is
+the only failing test in the suite.
+
+## Blocked
+
+Add `tests/query-task-outcomes.test.ts` to task 6's `scope` so its obsolete
+`prints task_outcomes last` assertion can be reworded to the delta's wording
+(`task_outcomes` directly after `link_findings`, which the new
+`tests/query-pauses.test.ts` already proves), or drop that case from it. Until
+then the change-level `pnpm verify` fails on that preexisting test and this task
+cannot be finished within its scope.
+
+## Next
+
+Reword the `task outcomes listed` case in `tests/query-task-outcomes.test.ts`;
+nothing else in the acceptance is outstanding.
+
